  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "The open beta does not save the last selected region for creating new instances. It will reset every time you create a new instance.\nThe behaviour appears to default to whatever you selected in the current live version of VRChat.\nYou can test this by going back to live, and changing your region when creating a new instance, and you will see this persist over to the open beta.",
